data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Defining the Summarization Scope**\n\nOkay, I'm now zeroing in on defining what precisely constitutes an L4 summarization in the context of this egocentric action-prediction dataset. The challenge is to group the L3 actions into higher-level, goal-oriented phases. I am currently considering the initial action, \"travel to cafeteria building,\" as a building block for forming those broader phases.\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-pro-default","responseId": "H2miau2qDNWQ-8YP_b6T8QI","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 1977,"totalTokenCount": 1977}}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Refining the Action Decomposition**\n\nI've just refined the action groupings further. I've consolidated \"getting and eating dinner at the cafeteria\" into Phase 1. Subsequently, Phase 2, \"Transitioning to and spending time at the fitness center, assisting a partner, and conversing,\" is also consolidated. The gym activities were deconstructed into arriving, inspecting, assisting, discussing, and leaving.\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-pro-default","responseId": "H2miau2qDNWQ-8YP_b6T8QI","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 1977,"totalTokenCount": 1977}}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Analyzing Phase Segmentation**\n\nI'm now reconsidering the L4 phase breakdowns based on L3 activity episodes. It seems \"Having dinner at the cafeteria\" remains Phase 1. I'm focusing on the gym session. Is it a single L4 phase? I'm inclined to merge arriving and inspecting with the assisting/socializing activities at the gym into \"I assist my partner's workout and discuss various topics at the gym.\" The final action of leaving is triggered externally, so it is a good standalone item for the time being.\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-pro-default","responseId": "H2miau2qDNWQ-8YP_b6T8QI","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 1977,"totalTokenCount": 1977}}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Revising Phase Boundaries**\n\nI am now focusing on the optimal boundaries for the L4 phases, particularly around the gym activities. The temporal aspects are revealing: combining \"travel and orient\" and \"assist and converse\" is supported by roughly 22 minutes of action, which makes a strong case for two gym-centric phases. The dinner is approximately 11 minutes. Then another 8 minutes getting to the gym. The final L4 phase, then, is about half a minute. The current breakdown into three phases now looks very promising.\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-pro-default","responseId": "H2miau2qDNWQ-8YP_b6T8QI","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 1977,"totalTokenCount": 1977}}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Validating Semantic Consistency**\n\nI'm now focused on validating the phase descriptions against semantic rules. I'm modifying Phase 1 to be \"I have dinner at the cafeteria\", which consolidates travel, ordering, eating, and tray return. Phase 2 may be: \"I travel to the fitness center and orient myself to the facilities\" or \"I orient myself to the fitness center upon arrival.\" Phase 4 \"my companion initiates our departure\", is a clean, succinct boundary-defining trigger. It validates well as a standalone event.\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-pro-default","responseId": "H2miau2qDNWQ-8YP_b6T8QI","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 1977,"totalTokenCount": 1977}}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Finalizing Phase Summaries**\n\nI'm now revising the phase descriptions to ensure clarity and conciseness. Phase 2 is now \"I relocate to the fitness center and survey the facilities.\" I've updated Phase 3 to \"I participate in a social gym session involving workout assistance and discussions on research and technology,\" which removes \"while\" and maintains concurrency. Finally, Phase 4 is \"I prepare to leave the fitness center following my companion's initiation.\" Phase 1 is now \"I consume a meal at the cafeteria,\" covering events 0-3.\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-pro-default","responseId": "H2miau2qDNWQ-8YP_b6T8QI","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 1977,"totalTokenCount": 1977}}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Refining Event Descriptions**\n\nI'm now revising the event descriptions to strictly adhere to the established summarization rules. I've found \"I attend a dinner session at the cafeteria\" to be compliant for the initial phase. Next, I'm considering \"I establish my presence at the fitness center\" for the second, or \"I transition to the fitness center for a workout session.\" Lastly, I'm considering \"I support my partner's workout regimen while discussing research and technology\" for the longest remaining episode.\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-pro-default","responseId": "H2miau2qDNWQ-8YP_b6T8QI","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 1977,"totalTokenCount": 1977}}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Evaluating Phase Separation**\n\nI'm now determining if phases 4-5 and 6-13 are distinct enough at the L4 level. Arrival, and inspection versus active assisting and social interaction in the gym are distinct. A single \"social workout\" seems too broad. Phases 0-3 at the cafeteria, and 4-14 at the gym, feel distinct enough. I need to make the departure explicit at the end of the final phase.\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-pro-default","responseId": "H2miau2qDNWQ-8YP_b6T8QI","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 1977,"totalTokenCount": 1977}}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Consolidating Gym Arrival**\n\nI'm now integrating the gym arrival. I am changing phase 2 to be \"I familiarize myself with the fitness center upon arrival\" to represent this more succinctly. The JSON structure now includes the descriptions of dining, orienting at the gym, supporting a workout, and the departure trigger. Finally, I believe the descriptions, and plan structure are nearing completion.\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-pro-default","responseId": "H2miau2qDNWQ-8YP_b6T8QI","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 1977,"totalTokenCount": 1977}}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Reviewing Time-Series Correspondence**\n\nI'm verifying the temporal alignment of the events now. I've re-examined the timing and action-trigger rules, making sure each moment aligns with the correct phase. I'm choosing \"I survey the fitness center upon arrival\" to represent events 4-5. The departure trigger is also validated, and the phase descriptions are ready for final implementation.\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-pro-default","responseId": "H2miau2qDNWQ-8YP_b6T8QI","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 1977,"totalTokenCount": 1977}}

